  "definitions": {
    "ResizeEngineInstanceReq": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "oper_type"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "oper_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "[vertical](tag:hws,hws_eu,hws_hk,ocb,hws_ocb,ctc,g42,hk_g42,tm,sbc,hk_sbc,hk_tm,fcs,dt,cmcc,ax,srg)[horizontal](tag:hcs,fcs,hcs_oemout)",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n变更类型。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n- storage:存储空间扩容,节点数量不变。\n- horizontal:RocketMQ 5.x为实例规格扩容。RocketMQ 4.8.0为代理数扩容。\n- vertical:垂直扩容,broker的底层虚机规格变更,代理数量和存储空间不变,仅RocketMQ 4.8.0支持。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。"
        },
        "new_storage_space": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "example": 600,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n新存储规格\n**约束限制**:\n当oper_type类型是storage时,该参数有效且必填。\n\n- 当oper_type类型是storage时,每个broker存储空间最少扩容100GB。\n\n- 当oper_type类型是horizontal时,每个broker的存储空间不变。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。"
        },
        "new_product_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "c6.4u8g.cluster",
          "x-no-support-region": "hcs",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n新产品ID\n**约束限制**:\n - RocketMQ 5.x:当oper_type类型是horizontal时该参数有效且必填,规格变更仅限于集群实例。\n- RocketMQ 4.8.0:当oper_type类型是vertical时该参数有效且必填,规格变更仅限于集群实例。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。"
        },
        "new_broker_num": {
          "x-no-support-region": "dt",
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "example": 5,
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n代理数量\n**约束限制**:\n当oper_type参数为horizontal时,该参数必填。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。"
        },
        "publicip_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "********-88fc-4a8c-86d0-************,********-16af-455d-8d54-************,********-3d69-4367-95ab-************",
          "description": "**参数解释**:\n实例绑定的弹性IP地址的ID。以英文逗号隔开多个弹性IP地址的ID。\n**约束限制**:\n 当oper_type参数为horizontal且开启了公网访问时,此参数必填。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。"
        }
      },
      "x-request-examples-tags-1": "hws,hws_eu,hws_hk,ocb,hws_ocb,ctc,g42,hk_g42,tm,sbc,hk_sbc,hk_tm,fcs,dt,cmcc,ax,srg",
